Aerie-Purpose: Give the Aerie Guard page the strings of its own-rules text box: the heading, the buttons, the reason for each dropped or ignored rule and the errors of a refused save.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings (settings_localized_strings_provider.cc)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #107. The messages are in the overlay's aerie_guard_settings_strings.grdp, which
adblock/0022 already includes. This patch hands each one to the Settings page in a function
of its own, so it does not share context lines with the table that adblock/0022 adds. A test
compares the names with the grdp.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/settings/settings_localized_strings_provider.cc
@@ -1641,6 +1641,56 @@
   html_source->AddLocalizedStrings(kLocalizedStrings);
 }
 
